TapiocaOptionBroker_setPause.tree
├── when caller is not authorized
│   └── it should revert with NotAuthorized
└── when caller is authorized
    ├── when pauseState is true
    │   ├── it should pause contract
    │   └── it should emit Pause event with true
    └── when pauseState is false
        ├── it should unpause contract
        └── it should emit Pause event with false
